    },
    {
        "text": "And that'll conclude this factory's handover.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_267_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything up till now has been as smooth as ice, thanks to your mediation, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_267_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I might have been a little neglectful beforehand. I'm very sorry for that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_267_1#7$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Don't mind it, I'm just a scholar.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_267_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My, no need to be so humble. There's plenty still to come that'll require your guidance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "One moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_267_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, do you have some qualm about this, General Valais?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1"
    },
    {
