    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's General Valais for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're here to get an explanation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_267_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Weiss and the Doctor should have just conveyed to the subjects' representatives the steps Karlan Trade's taking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_267_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There must have been some misunderstanding...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Misunderstanding?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Mr. Chester, I think you don't get it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir Enciodes was tricked by this foreigner!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Come again?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were all kept in the dark. We only realized what was happening once someone told us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Chester, you should know this foreigner's 'original' purpose in Kjerag was to advise on Oripathy and Infected handling methods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's your point?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_267_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our informant is never wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This foreigner's already in cahoots with Arctosz, and it's your job to keep eyes on the 'guest', General Valais.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone knows Arctosz and the Vine-Bead Court were never happy with how Sir Enciodes opened up Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The foreigner's going to say the factories spread Oripathy as an excuse to shut them forever with gross slander against the lord!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one speaking slander! The Paleroches would never stoop to such unsightly lows!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Paleroches and the Vine-Bead Court are all tied up! You don't think anything 'unsightly?' You don't think enough people have lost their lives?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
