        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Um, you can stop running. Let's put me down.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh! Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Pant*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to reiterate, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what plans you have, this is far too dangerous. You probably don't remember, but I've told you the same thing many, many times before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Believe me, I believe you.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyone can make mistakes, even me. If you're willing, I hope you can make my work a bit easier on me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "The possibility's not high, but what would you have done if more professional combatants were snuck into that attack?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they brought crossbows, what then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Don't worry, their goal isn't to kill me.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll report the situation to the Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Captain Sharp and I both followed your confidant's message, heading separately to the Browntails' residence and the Silverashes' factories to pursue suspicious personnel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our trails ended up converging into one, surprisingly enough...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "These people were very likely incited by the Browntails.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Agitating civilians and smearing the competition are both common schemes, but they're crude.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Seems it's to stir conflict between me and the Silverashes.;Seems it's to stir conflict between the Paleroches and Silverashes.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "But it's also probably a trap.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their equipment and combat strength aren't up to par. It's not even enough to get them out in one piece.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "Suppose they were arrested and interrogated, and they gave up their source...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Then it would look bad for the Browntails?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "That's not the whole of it.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're lacking intel. We still can't see the full picture of this incident. No way to actually lock onto the hidden orchestrator or their goals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one thing we can be sure of is someone wants to disturb the tri-clan relations. That is to say, they want to shatter the Snow Realm's overall stability. Circumstances are exceptionally dangerous for outsiders like you, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do we do now, Doctor? Should we think of some way to make it back first?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "It's not time yet. This incident's far from over.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right, this charade's just one small part of the giant storm. But my duty's clear-cut\u2014I'm getting you out of danger, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I'm going to get more info.;I'm going to evade capture.;I'm going to stop whoever's stirring up the clans.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "The more you know, the more dangerous your situation. We likely won't have the time to ensure all the details, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "That might just be the start of it, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to remind you, Doctor, this may have long grown beyond your plans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "But since you're so determined, and seeing as you have a good grasp on things... we won't stop you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "At this point, do you plan on telling Courier and Matterhorn, and especially Cliffheart, considering they're all Silverashes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "No.;......;Up to you.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "Agreed. I'm sorry to Cliffheart, but now that we're here, it's hard for me to fully trust Courier and Matterhorn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, I know you want to trust them, but set aside Cliffheart for now\u2014it's hard for me not to be wary of Courier and Matterhorn in this current tri-clan dispute, no matter what.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I choose to keep part of the truth hidden from them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "For now, take me back.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
