    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_267_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah! So you're... I thought you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_267_1#4$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You thought I ran?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was a difficult situation there, and I lost sight of you. I hope you can forgive me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I made a mockery of myself, when I should by all rights have prioritized your safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As you can see... the people here have all been contained.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't move! Settle down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't think we don't know! You're here just to frame Sir Enciodes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You self-righteous hypocrite! Pah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Bro?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "......?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lara? Why are you here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bro! What are you doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh\u2014Why are you all mixed up with these people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's my boss!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_252"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave it. Now's not the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood, Captain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "To be honest, I have nitpicks with Karlan Trade's factory safety measures.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#2$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "The exhaust pipes are too close to the construction area. The layout's pure nonsense.;The protective gear given to workers is too low-coverage.;The Originium transport channels aren't secure enough.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_267_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have... you told Sir Enciodes about that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chester"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "You! You! You're a nasty piece of work after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "It's the truth.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't quite understand, so I have no way to judge if what you say is true.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it sounds at least somewhat reasonable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll never believe your vile lies! You! You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "I want you to behave or else! Have you given a thought to the sort of punishment you'll face for attacking an outside guest of honor in the Vine-Bead Court's territory?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So long as it's for Sir Enciodes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Silverashes' guest attacked by the Silverashes' subjects? Is there any way this won't smear the Silverash reputation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this how you 'repay Sir Enciodes?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...That...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Think about it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bro, you used to be so cool-headed. What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Forget it. You wouldn't understand if I told you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "General Valais. Let these people go.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#5$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "As you see, my subordinate has a relative here.;This is a misunderstanding. Don't make it any bigger.;Consider it compensation for your mistake there.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "General Valais, please be kind...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that really all it is? I'm not convinced.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*... You know what, forget it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Are you sure this settles it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up, all of you. If it wasn't for our guest's altruism, you'd all be in for a caning before the day is out! Reflect on your actions!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Valais"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't think you'll buy us off just like that! You rotten...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Subject"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_286_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave it, leave it. We're out of here. Don't disgrace the Silverashes any more than that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Soldier Leader"
    },
